       "widgetType": "html",
       "settings": {
        "html": "<section class=\"section why\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"sec-head center\">\n      <span class=\"eyebrow centered\">Why book with us</span>\n      <h2 class=\"h2\">Concierge care, <em>start to finish</em></h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"why-grid\">\n      <div class=\"why-card\">\n        <span class=\"ic\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"><path d=\"M12 2 4 6v6c0 5 3.5 8 8 10 4.5-2 8-5 8-10V6l-8-4Z\"/><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"/></svg></span>\n        <h3>End-to-end concierge</h3>\n        <p>One point of contact for every booking, transfer and reservation across your trip.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"why-card\">\n        <span class=\"ic\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"5\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M3 9h18M7 14h5\"/></svg></span>\n        <h3>Tourist visa assistance</h3>\n        <p>The right visa, processed quickly with clear guidance from start to approval.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"why-card\">\n        <span class=\"ic\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"><path d=\"M12 21s-7-5.6-7-11a7 7 0 0 1 14 0c0 5.4-7 11-7 11Z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"2.5\"/></svg></span>\n        <h3>Private guided tours</h3>\n        <p>Local guides who know the moments worth catching — and the hour to catch them.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"why-card\">\n        <span class=\"ic\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M12 7v5l3 2\"/></svg></span>\n        <h3>24/7 support</h3>\n        <p>Plans change. We're reachable on WhatsApp around the clock, every day of your stay.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
       }
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
