      {
       "id": "fbd0001b",
       "elType": "widget",
       "widgetType": "html",
       "settings": {
        "html": "<section class=\"section package\">\n  <div class=\"scene scene-dunes\"><div class=\"scene-sky\"></div><div class=\"scene-sun\"></div><img class=\"scene-img\" src=\"https://www.flybydeniz.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/desert-safari.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"scene-scrim\"></div></div>\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"pk-copy\">\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Featured Package</span>\n      <h2>Five days of Dubai, <em>perfectly paced</em></h2>\n      <p class=\"lead\">Our most-booked itinerary blends the icons with the in-between — the desert, the water, the skyline and the quiet luxuries that make a trip feel personal.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"pk-card\">\n      <span class=\"pk-tag\">Best Seller</span>\n      <h3>5-Day Dubai Discovery</h3>\n      <ul class=\"incl\">\n        <li><span class=\"ck\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg></span>Airport transfers & daily private transport</li>\n        <li><span class=\"ck\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg></span>Desert safari with dune dinner</li>\n        <li><span class=\"ck\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg></span>Burj Khalifa & Dubai Frame tickets</li>\n        <li><span class=\"ck\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg></span>Private yacht afternoon on the Marina</li>\n        <li><span class=\"ck\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg></span>Tourist visa assistance & 24/7 support</li>\n      </ul>\n      <div class=\"pk-foot\">\n        <div class=\"price\">\n          <div class=\"from\">From</div>\n          <div class=\"amt\">AED 4,900 <span>/ guest</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <a href=\"#contact\" class=\"btn btn--coral\">Reserve Your Spot\n          <svg class=\"arrow\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg>\n        </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
