       "elType": "widget",
       "widgetType": "html",
       "settings": {
        "html": "<section class=\"section testi\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"sec-head center\">\n      <span class=\"eyebrow centered\">Traveller Stories</span>\n      <h2 class=\"h2\">Trips they still <em>talk about</em></h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"testi-track\">\n      <div class=\"testi-slide active\">\n        <div class=\"q-card\">\n          <div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div>\n          <blockquote>\"They handled our visas, transfers and the desert night without a single hiccup. We just showed up and enjoyed Dubai.\"</blockquote>\n          <div class=\"who\"><span class=\"av\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#F0C277,#E8744F)\">M</span><span><div class=\"nm\">Marta K.</div><div class=\"ct\"> Germany</div></span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-card\">\n          <div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div>\n          <blockquote>\"The helicopter tour at golden hour was the highlight of our year. Fly By Deniz timed it perfectly.\"</blockquote>\n          <div class=\"who\"><span class=\"av\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#E8964A,#C95A38)\">J</span><span><div class=\"nm\">James O.</div><div class=\"ct\"> United Kingdom</div></span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-card\">\n          <div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div>\n          <blockquote>\"Travelling with three kids is hard — they made it feel easy. Private guide, flexible plan, always reachable.\"</blockquote>\n          <div class=\"who\"><span class=\"av\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#E0B14A,#E06B82)\">A</span><span><div class=\"nm\">Aisha R.</div><div class=\"ct\"> Saudi Arabia</div></span></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"testi-slide\">\n        <div class=\"q-card\">\n          <div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div>\n          <blockquote>\"We booked a last-minute yacht afternoon and they arranged everything within the hour. Genuinely seamless.\"</blockquote>\n          <div class=\"who\"><span class=\"av\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#D9B23C,#EE8A3C)\">S</span><span><div class=\"nm\">Sergey V.</div><div class=\"ct\"> Kazakhstan</div></span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-card\">\n          <div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div>\n          <blockquote>\"Local insight you can't get from an app. Their recommendations made the whole trip feel curated for us.\"</blockquote>\n          <div class=\"who\"><span class=\"av\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ECCB9C,#C96B4A)\">C</span><span><div class=\"nm\">Chloé D.</div><div class=\"ct\"> France</div></span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-card\">\n          <div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div>\n          <blockquote>\"Our MICE event ran flawlessly — venue, logistics and transfers all handled by one responsive team.\"</blockquote>\n          <div class=\"who\"><span class=\"av\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#F7C969,#D9453F)\">D</span><span><div class=\"nm\">Daniel M.</div><div class=\"ct\"> United States</div></span></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"testi-dots\">\n      <button class=\"active\" data-slide=\"0\" aria-label=\"Stories 1\"></button>\n      <button data-slide=\"1\" aria-label=\"Stories 2\"></button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
       }
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
