      {
       "id": "fbd00024",
       "elType": "widget",
       "widgetType": "html",
       "settings": {
        "html": "<section class=\"section why\" id=\"faq\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"faq-grid\">\n      <div>\n        <span class=\"eyebrow\">FAQ</span>\n        <h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"font-size:clamp(30px,3.4vw,46px);\">Good to <em>know</em></h2>\n        <p class=\"lead\" style=\"margin-top:18px;\">A few quick answers. For anything else, message us on WhatsApp — we usually reply within minutes.</p>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-link\" style=\"margin-top:22px;\">Read full FAQ\n          <svg class=\"arrow\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg>\n        </a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"faq-list\">\n        <div class=\"faq-item open\">\n          <button class=\"faq-q\">Can you help with my tourist visa?<span class=\"pm\">+</span></button>\n          <div class=\"faq-a\"><p>Yes — visa assistance is one of our core services. We advise on the right visa for your trip and handle processing with clear, guided steps from application to approval.</p></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"faq-item\">\n          <button class=\"faq-q\">How do payments work?<span class=\"pm\">+</span></button>\n          <div class=\"faq-a\"><p>We confirm your itinerary and pricing up front, with secure payment options. A deposit secures your booking and the balance is settled before your experiences begin.</p></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"faq-item\">\n          <button class=\"faq-q\">Do you arrange group bookings?<span class=\"pm\">+</span></button>\n          <div class=\"faq-a\"><p>Absolutely. We design tailored packages for families, friends and corporate groups — including MICE events — with logistics, transfers and private guides handled end to end.</p></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"faq-item\">\n          <button class=\"faq-q\">Are airport transfers included?<span class=\"pm\">+</span></button>\n          <div class=\"faq-a\"><p>Private airport and city transfers can be added to any package, or booked on their own. Your driver tracks your flight, so timing flexes with you.</p></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
       }
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  }
